e the film's crew  obviously kept track of major props like  the batmobile affleck did not think  anyone would notice if he stole a  batarang i kept getting these phone  calls from the prop department like you  sure you haven't found any of that stuff  yet the crew ended up realizing that  their star brought home a batarang and  even billed him for it batman is  notoriously wealthy so he'll probably be  fine  it activates the ring's higher functions  including a working knowledge base while  we have come to love ryan reynolds as  the merc with a mouth deadpool you may  have forgotten that he once played hal  jordan also known as green lantern  though reynolds would likely want you to  forget about that role  i'm sorry about that reynolds still  wanted to keep a memento from his time  as the intergalactic hero but it was  fairly difficult as there was not as  much to choose from as one might expect  one of the only physical props was of  course the hero's iconic ring which  reynolds ended up bringing home with him  along with marrying his co-star from the  film blake lively  he's a thousand years old and now he's  just an ornament in my living room  journey smallit really bonded with her  cast mates while filming birds of prey  to the point where she ended up taking  home props that didn't necessarily  belong to her character black canary i  got the good night back  don't tell harley not to worry as margot  robbie has a bat of her own as well  smallit also brought home the belly ring  and the nose ring that her character  wore throughout the movie seems like  smallit is just as stylish as black  canary figuring out how to cheat it's  very easy to corrupt  john cena was one of the biggest  highlights of james guns the suicide  squad playing the role of peacemaker  while many actors have been  uncomfortable with their super suits  cena grew up quite fond of them and  ended up taking the costume home with  him cena has even gone as far as to have  worn the costume to various places  including late night talk shows and the  film's red carpet premiere i've learned  that if you just keep the costume on  they don't ask for it back cena was even  able to continue wearing his beloved  toilet seat helmet and red yellow and a  blue suit for the peacemaker spin-off  series though james gunn teased cena  that if he doesn't return the costume  there might not be a second season of  the show  because i ate it okay  ella j bosco was one of the big  breakouts from birds of prey where she  starred as a young cassandra kane a  character who in the comics would go on  to become batgirl bosco had to wear a  pink arm cast for her character which  she started to take a liking to  throughout filming they ended up making  like  15 of them so there's like just take one  bosco even drew all over her casts while  filming to show off her artistic skills  proudly claiming that the cast was her  armor  well you think you can do better  zachary levy has always been very vocal  about being a bit more geek when it  comes to pop culture so playing the hero  shazam was a dream come true to him a  neon sign in the film's strip club scene  ended up catching levy's eye which led  him to start getting ideas if that gets  to live anywhere i wanted to like be in  like my garage or something so that's  that's where it is that's what i took  while levy is mighty proud of his on-set  souvenir from the film he said that he  would likely have to return it should  the production team ever need it again  i'm a natural-born thief so  jason mamoa and ezra miller have shown  just how excited they were to take on  the iconic roles of aquaman and the  flash while these two play superheroes  on screen sometimes it's hard to resist  taking something when it catches your  eye especially in the iconic bat cave  momoa and miller proudly took home what  they claim to be minor props both actors  took home bat bullets which were little  bullets with a tiny red cap on top mamoa  did try to clear the air by revealing  that he ended up giving the sleek prop  to his son  ray fisher has been vocal about his  experience working on justice league but  he still greatly enjoyed working with  zack snyder and the cast so of course an  up-and-coming actor like himself would  want to bring back a keepsake from the  film to show off to his friends and  family and he knew exactly what he  wanted victor's gotham city university  varsity jacket two versions of the  jacket were made for the film and fisher  ended up coaxing the production team to  let him quote on quote borrow one of  them i may let you guys see it one day  but no touching understood  my dad was definitely not into it as a  career choice  zack snyder is one of those directors  who is just as well known as many of the  stars of his movies and he naturally  took advantage of that kind of power he  even made a cameo appearance as a  customer at a cafe alongside ezra  miller's barry allen in the long-awaited  snyder cut of justice league snyder  brought home the painted portrait of  jeffrey dean morgan as batman's father  thomas wayne from the set of batman vs  superman dawn of justice and proudly  hung it up in his home gym consider it a  trophy of sorts meow michelle pfeiffer  was a fan favorite in the role of  batman's seductive rival slash lover  catwoman in the sequel batman returns of  course the feline themed character is  not complete without her trusty whip and  phifer couldn't fight the urge to take  the weapon home with her pfeiffer has  the iconic whip hanging in her closet at  home though she stresses that it can be  very dangerous these things can draw  blood matt ryan won over the hearts of  fans in his portrayal as dc anti-hero  constantine in the nbc series but the  series tragically only lasted one season  fortunately he found second life for the  character in the arrowverse while ryan  wasn't able to grab anything on set  while he was on the set of arrow he did  take a major prop from 